# oracle: create_atoms box on an orthogonal box with a lattice that does not tile it exactly (bcc-like two-atom custom cell, 0.8442): atom IDs and positions by ID after run 0 (the orthogonal path is unchanged by the triclinic fix)
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         custom 0.8442 a1 1 0 0 a2 0 1 0 a3 0 0 1 basis 0 0 0 basis 0.5 0.5 0.5
region          box block 0 3.3 0 2.7 0 2.0
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box basis 1 1 basis 2 2
mass            * 1.0
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
